"  Transfers   Share   Settings                            ↓9.8M  ↑1.6M  [green] "
"────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
" Changes to peers apply when the engine restarts.                               "
"   Time                              12h                                        "
"   Idle timeout                      10m                                        "
"   At the limit                      stop it                                    "
"                                                                                "
" Network                                                                        "
" On by default so direct sends work behind home routers. Move to a row to read  "
" what it shares.                                                                "
"   Port ╔ + Add a tracker ═════════════════════════════════════════════╗        "
"   Relay║ https://…                                                    ║        "
"   LAN d║                                                              ║        "
"        ║ An http:// or https:// URL.                                  ║        "
" Tracker╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝        "
" Every transfer announces to these so peers can find it, as well as to the      "
" trackers its link names. A tracker can also list what you publish to it.       "
"▌  https://tracker.example.org/announce                                         "
"────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
" enter changes the URL; x removes it.                                           "
"                                                                                "
" • marks settings changed here, over the config file.                           "
"────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
" enter save  esc cancel                                                         "
